Subject: errors using new lme4 and lmerTest updates
Message-ID: <ccek6Pgg_D8.YyiAYhsvDsMJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/davis-rug/c/ccek6Pgg_D8/m/YyiAYhsvDsMJ>
